{"ts": 1792837650.6358745, "text": "换到全黑", "source": "env", "env_id": "dark"}
{"ts": 1792837650.6361318, "text": "换到跪趴", "source": "position", "position": "kneeling"}
{"ts": 1792837670.9896638, "text": "大腿摊开，脚掌踩在床上，稳。", "source": "body_reaction", "stage": 1, "toy_id": "feather"}
{"ts": 1792837670.9908872, "text": "耳垂那里被轻轻扫了一下。整个人打了个冷颤。", "source": "body_reaction", "stage": 2, "toy_id": "feather"}
{"ts": 1792837670.991844, "text": "她的头发湿了贴在脖子上。用手指拨开。露出来的脖子线条让人想咬。", "source": "body_reaction", "stage": 3, "toy_id": "feather"}
{"ts": 1792837670.993129, "text": "浴室里全是雾。看不清她的脸。只有喘息声特别清楚。", "source": "body_reaction", "stage": 4, "toy_id": "feather"}
{"ts": 1792837670.994213, "text": "忍不住了。声音从喉咙深处挤出来。低的。", "source": "body_reaction", "stage": 5, "toy_id": "feather"}
{"ts": 1792837670.9953692, "text": "大腿内侧全是汗。湿黏黏的。肌肉还在跳。", "source": "body_reaction", "stage": 6, "toy_id": "feather"}
{"ts": 1792837670.997402, "text": "换到侧躺", "source": "position", "position": "lying_side"}
{"ts": 1792837670.9994085, "text": "换到烛光", "source": "env", "env_id": "candle"}
{"ts": 1792837701.758186, "text": "臀缝的汗在往下流。", "source": "body_reaction", "stage": 1, "toy_id": "vibrator"}
